T1  - Trust requirements in sociotechnical systems: A systematic literature review
AU  - Roque, Geicianfran
AU  - Nascimento, José
AU  - Souza, Rafael
AU  - Alves, Carina
AU  - Araújo, João
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 186
