T1  - Verifying contracts among software components: An ontology-based approach
AU  - Castillo-Barrera, Francisco-Edgar
AU  - Duran-Limon, Hector A.
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 163
SP  - 107282
PY  - 2023
DA  - 2023/11/01/
SN  - 0950-5849
